{
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "I'm Major Dream Williams. This is Maim",
      "start_ms": "960",
      "end_ms": "6960",
      "start_time_text": "0:00"
    },
    {
      "text": "Academy. We build things that run",
      "start_ms": "4160",
      "end_ms": "9599",
      "start_time_text": "0:04"
    },
    {
      "text": "without you.",
      "start_ms": "6960",
      "end_ms": "12879.999999999998",
      "start_time_text": "0:06"
    },
    {
      "text": "You have a ceiling.",
      "start_ms": "9599",
      "end_ms": "15040",
      "start_time_text": "0:09"
    },
    {
      "text": "I don't know if you know this or not,",
      "start_ms": "12880",
      "end_ms": "18960",
      "start_time_text": "0:12"
    },
    {
      "text": "but you yourself, you're not scalable.",
      "start_ms": "15040",
      "end_ms": "22799.999999999996",
      "start_time_text": "0:15"
    },
    {
      "text": "There's not two or three of you.",
      "start_ms": "18960",
      "end_ms": "27039",
      "start_time_text": "0:18"
    },
    {
      "text": "Look, any income built on your hours has",
      "start_ms": "22800",
      "end_ms": "28720",
      "start_time_text": "0:22"
    },
    {
      "text": "a ceiling.",
      "start_ms": "27039",
      "end_ms": "31199",
      "start_time_text": "0:27"
    },
    {
      "text": "You can calculate it. Most people never",
      "start_ms": "28720",
      "end_ms": "34000",
      "start_time_text": "0:28"
    },
    {
      "text": "do because the number is unpleasant. You",
      "start_ms": "31199",
      "end_ms": "38960",
      "start_time_text": "0:31"
    },
    {
      "text": "never want to figure like, okay, I'm",
      "start_ms": "34000",
      "end_ms": "43120",
      "start_time_text": "0:34"
    },
    {
      "text": "laboring and I just can't get past that.",
      "start_ms": "38960",
      "end_ms": "46879",
      "start_time_text": "0:38"
    },
    {
      "text": "You know that feeling that you get when",
      "start_ms": "43120",
      "end_ms": "50078.99999999999",
      "start_time_text": "0:43"
    },
    {
      "text": "the bills increase but your paycheck",
      "start_ms": "46879",
      "end_ms": "56399",
      "start_time_text": "0:46"
    },
    {
      "text": "never does? This is what the ceiling is.",
      "start_ms": "50079",
      "end_ms": "59840",
      "start_time_text": "0:50"
    },
    {
      "text": "And yeah, most people, and this is why",
      "start_ms": "56399",
      "end_ms": "62640",
      "start_time_text": "0:56"
    },
    {
      "text": "people get upset and you know, they ride",
      "start_ms": "59840",
      "end_ms": "64479",
      "start_time_text": "0:59"
    },
    {
      "text": "home on the train and everybody's just",
      "start_ms": "62640",
      "end_ms": "68400",
      "start_time_text": "1:02"
    },
    {
      "text": "looking all grim because deep inside",
      "start_ms": "64479",
      "end_ms": "71200",
      "start_time_text": "1:04"
    },
    {
      "text": "they know that",
      "start_ms": "68400",
      "end_ms": "73840",
      "start_time_text": "1:08"
    },
    {
      "text": "they're capped.",
      "start_ms": "71200",
      "end_ms": "76560",
      "start_time_text": "1:11"
    },
    {
      "text": "Their head is bumping against the wall.",
      "start_ms": "73840",
      "end_ms": "80240.00000000001",
      "start_time_text": "1:13"
    },
    {
      "text": "Not because they're not good enough, but",
      "start_ms": "76560",
      "end_ms": "82320.00000000001",
      "start_time_text": "1:16"
    },
    {
      "text": "because of the the decision that they",
      "start_ms": "80240",
      "end_ms": "85919.99999999999",
      "start_time_text": "1:20"
    },
    {
      "text": "made involved a calculation that most",
      "start_ms": "82320",
      "end_ms": "89199.99999999999",
      "start_time_text": "1:22"
    },
    {
      "text": "people never try to figure out. You",
      "start_ms": "85920",
      "end_ms": "91200",
      "start_time_text": "1:25"
    },
    {
      "text": "never try to figure out what your number",
      "start_ms": "89200",
      "end_ms": "92880.00000000001",
      "start_time_text": "1:29"
    },
    {
      "text": "is",
      "start_ms": "91200",
      "end_ms": "94720",
      "start_time_text": "1:31"
    },
    {
      "text": "because when you do, you realize it's",
      "start_ms": "92880",
      "end_ms": "99920",
      "start_time_text": "1:32"
    },
    {
      "text": "just unpleasant. Okay, the calculation.",
      "start_ms": "94720",
      "end_ms": "103600",
      "start_time_text": "1:34"
    },
    {
      "text": "Real hours, the hours of high value work",
      "start_ms": "99920",
      "end_ms": "107040",
      "start_time_text": "1:39"
    },
    {
      "text": "only you can do. That's three to five",
      "start_ms": "103600",
      "end_ms": "110798.99999999999",
      "start_time_text": "1:43"
    },
    {
      "text": "hours a day, not eight. The real weeks,",
      "start_ms": "107040",
      "end_ms": "115439",
      "start_time_text": "1:47"
    },
    {
      "text": "44 to 46 a year, not 52, you know, you",
      "start_ms": "110799",
      "end_ms": "118079.00000000001",
      "start_time_text": "1:50"
    },
    {
      "text": "get those vacations and then weekends,",
      "start_ms": "115439",
      "end_ms": "121798.99999999999",
      "start_time_text": "1:55"
    },
    {
      "text": "you know, type stuff.",
      "start_ms": "118079",
      "end_ms": "121798.99999999999",
      "start_time_text": "1:58"
    },
    {
      "text": "Then your rate,",
      "start_ms": "121920",
      "end_ms": "127360",
      "start_time_text": "2:01"
    },
    {
      "text": "what someone actually pays for your",
      "start_ms": "124560",
      "end_ms": "130319.00000000001",
      "start_time_text": "2:04"
    },
    {
      "text": "hour, for an hour of your work, what are",
      "start_ms": "127360",
      "end_ms": "134400",
      "start_time_text": "2:07"
    },
    {
      "text": "they willing to pay? That's how you",
      "start_ms": "130318.99999999999",
      "end_ms": "136879",
      "start_time_text": "2:10"
    },
    {
      "text": "calculate it. So you take your hours a",
      "start_ms": "134400",
      "end_ms": "140800",
      "start_time_text": "2:14"
    },
    {
      "text": "day times your days a week times your",
      "start_ms": "136879",
      "end_ms": "144959",
      "start_time_text": "2:16"
    },
    {
      "text": "weeks a year times your rate and that",
      "start_ms": "140800",
      "end_ms": "147920.00000000003",
      "start_time_text": "2:20"
    },
    {
      "text": "equals your ceiling.",
      "start_ms": "144959",
      "end_ms": "151120",
      "start_time_text": "2:24"
    },
    {
      "text": "It's the most you can earn while",
      "start_ms": "147920",
      "end_ms": "154000",
      "start_time_text": "2:27"
    },
    {
      "text": "somebody chooses to hire you. Do you get",
      "start_ms": "151120",
      "end_ms": "158080",
      "start_time_text": "2:31"
    },
    {
      "text": "that? It's the most you can earn if",
      "start_ms": "154000",
      "end_ms": "161200",
      "start_time_text": "2:34"
    },
    {
      "text": "somebody else chooses to hire you for",
      "start_ms": "158080",
      "end_ms": "166239",
      "start_time_text": "2:38"
    },
    {
      "text": "what you can do in their business.",
      "start_ms": "161200",
      "end_ms": "166238.99999999997",
      "start_time_text": "2:41"
    },
    {
      "text": "Have you ever calculated that before?",
      "start_ms": "166720",
      "end_ms": "174400",
      "start_time_text": "2:46"
    },
    {
      "text": "Or do you just accept your salary and",
      "start_ms": "170720",
      "end_ms": "177680",
      "start_time_text": "2:50"
    },
    {
      "text": "look at that paycheck?",
      "start_ms": "174400",
      "end_ms": "181560",
      "start_time_text": "2:54"
    },
    {
      "text": "How does that make you feel?",
      "start_ms": "177680",
      "end_ms": "181560",
      "start_time_text": "2:57"
    },
    {
      "text": "Now, if your goal is above that line,",
      "start_ms": "182800",
      "end_ms": "189280",
      "start_time_text": "3:02"
    },
    {
      "text": "you have an arithmetic problem, not an",
      "start_ms": "186879",
      "end_ms": "192239",
      "start_time_text": "3:06"
    },
    {
      "text": "effort problem. Waking up early doesn't",
      "start_ms": "189280",
      "end_ms": "194319",
      "start_time_text": "3:09"
    },
    {
      "text": "fix the arithmetic.",
      "start_ms": "192239",
      "end_ms": "198319.00000000003",
      "start_time_text": "3:12"
    },
    {
      "text": "Three ways could raise the rate. It",
      "start_ms": "194319",
      "end_ms": "200079.99999999997",
      "start_time_text": "3:14"
    },
    {
      "text": "works until nobody wants to give you",
      "start_ms": "198319",
      "end_ms": "203839.99999999997",
      "start_time_text": "3:18"
    },
    {
      "text": "anymore. You can add more people",
      "start_ms": "200080",
      "end_ms": "206480.00000000003",
      "start_time_text": "3:20"
    },
    {
      "text": "if it works until you become the",
      "start_ms": "203840",
      "end_ms": "209360",
      "start_time_text": "3:23"
    },
    {
      "text": "bottleneck for all those people. Or you",
      "start_ms": "206480",
      "end_ms": "212480",
      "start_time_text": "3:26"
    },
    {
      "text": "could stop selling your hours, build a",
      "start_ms": "209360",
      "end_ms": "215519",
      "start_time_text": "3:29"
    },
    {
      "text": "system, a product,",
      "start_ms": "212480",
      "end_ms": "219238.99999999997",
      "start_time_text": "3:32"
    },
    {
      "text": "or an AI agent.",
      "start_ms": "215519",
      "end_ms": "219239",
      "start_time_text": "3:35"
    },
    {
      "text": "You knew that was coming. Yeah. I mean,",
      "start_ms": "219760",
      "end_ms": "224239",
      "start_time_text": "3:39"
    },
    {
      "text": "at the end of the day, there's there's a",
      "start_ms": "222400",
      "end_ms": "226480.00000000003",
      "start_time_text": "3:42"
    },
    {
      "text": "few ways you can you can get it. So, you",
      "start_ms": "224239",
      "end_ms": "229440",
      "start_time_text": "3:44"
    },
    {
      "text": "have three ways to solve this ceiling,",
      "start_ms": "226480",
      "end_ms": "232798.99999999997",
      "start_time_text": "3:46"
    },
    {
      "text": "right? You can negotiate for more money,",
      "start_ms": "229440",
      "end_ms": "235920",
      "start_time_text": "3:49"
    },
    {
      "text": "which a lot of you feel that this is",
      "start_ms": "232799",
      "end_ms": "238239",
      "start_time_text": "3:52"
    },
    {
      "text": "what you want to do because we've seen",
      "start_ms": "235920",
      "end_ms": "241839.99999999997",
      "start_time_text": "3:55"
    },
    {
      "text": "it on TV. I need more. You go and",
      "start_ms": "238239",
      "end_ms": "245599.00000000003",
      "start_time_text": "3:58"
    },
    {
      "text": "negotiate. But say your boss doesn't",
      "start_ms": "241840",
      "end_ms": "248159",
      "start_time_text": "4:01"
    },
    {
      "text": "think you're valuable enough. You've",
      "start_ms": "245599",
      "end_ms": "250879",
      "start_time_text": "4:05"
    },
    {
      "text": "played your hand. You've gotten shut",
      "start_ms": "248159",
      "end_ms": "252480",
      "start_time_text": "4:08"
    },
    {
      "text": "down.",
      "start_ms": "250879",
      "end_ms": "254720",
      "start_time_text": "4:10"
    },
    {
      "text": "And then",
      "start_ms": "252480",
      "end_ms": "257039.99999999997",
      "start_time_text": "4:12"
    },
    {
      "text": "you're right back to where you start",
      "start_ms": "254720",
      "end_ms": "259918.99999999997",
      "start_time_text": "4:14"
    },
    {
      "text": "having to make tough decisions.",
      "start_ms": "257040.00000000003",
      "end_ms": "263280.00000000006",
      "start_time_text": "4:17"
    },
    {
      "text": "Or let's say this, you want to hire more",
      "start_ms": "259918.99999999997",
      "end_ms": "264799.99999999994",
      "start_time_text": "4:19"
    },
    {
      "text": "people.",
      "start_ms": "263280",
      "end_ms": "267840",
      "start_time_text": "4:23"
    },
    {
      "text": "So you get more people to do your work",
      "start_ms": "264800",
      "end_ms": "269759",
      "start_time_text": "4:24"
    },
    {
      "text": "because",
      "start_ms": "267840",
      "end_ms": "271599.99999999994",
      "start_time_text": "4:27"
    },
    {
      "text": "being a business owner sometimes means",
      "start_ms": "269759",
      "end_ms": "274000",
      "start_time_text": "4:29"
    },
    {
      "text": "that you're an employee of the business.",
      "start_ms": "271600",
      "end_ms": "276639",
      "start_time_text": "4:31"
    },
    {
      "text": "So you hire more people. That's a higher",
      "start_ms": "274000",
      "end_ms": "280080",
      "start_time_text": "4:34"
    },
    {
      "text": "payroll. You may get more contracts, but",
      "start_ms": "276639",
      "end_ms": "282960.00000000006",
      "start_time_text": "4:36"
    },
    {
      "text": "at the end of the day, you may still",
      "start_ms": "280080",
      "end_ms": "286599.99999999994",
      "start_time_text": "4:40"
    },
    {
      "text": "become the bottleneck.",
      "start_ms": "282960",
      "end_ms": "286599.99999999994",
      "start_time_text": "4:42"
    },
    {
      "text": "That's kind of what happens with a lot",
      "start_ms": "286639",
      "end_ms": "291440",
      "start_time_text": "4:46"
    },
    {
      "text": "of when you hire subordinates,",
      "start_ms": "288880",
      "end_ms": "296159.99999999994",
      "start_time_text": "4:48"
    },
    {
      "text": "employees, versus hiring people to help",
      "start_ms": "291440",
      "end_ms": "300080",
      "start_time_text": "4:51"
    },
    {
      "text": "you expand the business in a way that",
      "start_ms": "296160",
      "end_ms": "302320.00000000006",
      "start_time_text": "4:56"
    },
    {
      "text": "doesn't put you at the center of the",
      "start_ms": "300080",
      "end_ms": "306080",
      "start_time_text": "5:00"
    },
    {
      "text": "business. or",
      "start_ms": "302320",
      "end_ms": "309120",
      "start_time_text": "5:02"
    },
    {
      "text": "forget all that hours stuff. Forget all",
      "start_ms": "306080",
      "end_ms": "313440",
      "start_time_text": "5:06"
    },
    {
      "text": "that hours. Think smarter, not harder.",
      "start_ms": "309120",
      "end_ms": "317039",
      "start_time_text": "5:09"
    },
    {
      "text": "Right? Build a system. The system is",
      "start_ms": "313440",
      "end_ms": "320639",
      "start_time_text": "5:13"
    },
    {
      "text": "scalable. The system lives without you.",
      "start_ms": "317039",
      "end_ms": "323120",
      "start_time_text": "5:17"
    },
    {
      "text": "The system works",
      "start_ms": "320639",
      "end_ms": "325440",
      "start_time_text": "5:20"
    },
    {
      "text": "when you're not around.",
      "start_ms": "323120",
      "end_ms": "327759",
      "start_time_text": "5:23"
    },
    {
      "text": "You could build a product. How many",
      "start_ms": "325440",
      "end_ms": "329919",
      "start_time_text": "5:25"
    },
    {
      "text": "people have become billionaires because",
      "start_ms": "327759",
      "end_ms": "333039",
      "start_time_text": "5:27"
    },
    {
      "text": "they built something? I had a cousin",
      "start_ms": "329919",
      "end_ms": "335919",
      "start_time_text": "5:29"
    },
    {
      "text": "that built a double dutch machine.",
      "start_ms": "333039",
      "end_ms": "337759",
      "start_time_text": "5:33"
    },
    {
      "text": "Growing up watching girls play double",
      "start_ms": "335919",
      "end_ms": "340960",
      "start_time_text": "5:35"
    },
    {
      "text": "dutch, you know,",
      "start_ms": "337759",
      "end_ms": "343600",
      "start_time_text": "5:37"
    },
    {
      "text": "versus just skipping rope or one hand",
      "start_ms": "340960",
      "end_ms": "346560",
      "start_time_text": "5:40"
    },
    {
      "text": "rope. Double Dutch is a crossover,",
      "start_ms": "343600",
      "end_ms": "348160",
      "start_time_text": "5:43"
    },
    {
      "text": "right? So, this is what we play in the",
      "start_ms": "346560",
      "end_ms": "350160",
      "start_time_text": "5:46"
    },
    {
      "text": "hood.",
      "start_ms": "348160",
      "end_ms": "352639",
      "start_time_text": "5:48"
    },
    {
      "text": "And one of my cousins built a double",
      "start_ms": "350160",
      "end_ms": "355840.00000000006",
      "start_time_text": "5:50"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dutch machine that can do that for you.",
      "start_ms": "352639",
      "end_ms": "357919",
      "start_time_text": "5:52"
    },
    {
      "text": "She made millions of dollars, millions",
      "start_ms": "355840",
      "end_ms": "361198.99999999994",
      "start_time_text": "5:55"
    },
    {
      "text": "of dollars, super young, super early. So",
      "start_ms": "357919",
      "end_ms": "363840",
      "start_time_text": "5:57"
    },
    {
      "text": "that's something that you can also do.",
      "start_ms": "361199",
      "end_ms": "367360",
      "start_time_text": "6:01"
    },
    {
      "text": "Build a product, build a system, build a",
      "start_ms": "363840",
      "end_ms": "370719.99999999994",
      "start_time_text": "6:03"
    },
    {
      "text": "product, or you can gain the right",
      "start_ms": "367360",
      "end_ms": "373919.00000000006",
      "start_time_text": "6:07"
    },
    {
      "text": "mindset and build yourself an AI agent.",
      "start_ms": "370720",
      "end_ms": "378479.00000000006",
      "start_time_text": "6:10"
    },
    {
      "text": "Build yourself digital workers that do",
      "start_ms": "373919",
      "end_ms": "382318.99999999994",
      "start_time_text": "6:13"
    },
    {
      "text": "all of the things that you need to do in",
      "start_ms": "378479",
      "end_ms": "384719.99999999994",
      "start_time_text": "6:18"
    },
    {
      "text": "your corporation. We live in the world",
      "start_ms": "382319",
      "end_ms": "388160",
      "start_time_text": "6:22"
    },
    {
      "text": "of the billiondoll single person",
      "start_ms": "384720",
      "end_ms": "392160",
      "start_time_text": "6:24"
    },
    {
      "text": "company. Now will everybody do that? No.",
      "start_ms": "388160",
      "end_ms": "395120",
      "start_time_text": "6:28"
    },
